                            // dc-gridview (grid view, page 1, default sort/filters) is pre-rendered as
                            // static HTML (6 cards), along with dc-count/dc-page-info/dc-page-nav. render()
                            // runs once at the end of this module to bring it up to state.size (12 cards),
                            // and again on every search/filter/sort/page change or CRUD mutation.
                            // Likewise dc-kpis/dc-deptwidget/dc-loswidget/
                            // dc-clearance and the hero badges are pre-rendered
                            // as static HTML matching buildKPIs()'s default output, so it no longer needs to
                            // run on initial load — it still runs from the real mutation handlers (create,
